WEBVTT

00:17.616 --> 00:19.443
Your order is ready,
Mr. Bass.
您的订单已准备好，
巴斯先生。

00:20.719 --> 00:22.064
Whoops.
哎呀。

00:22.064 --> 00:23.443
Whoa!
哇！

00:23.443 --> 00:25.202
Ah, ah!
啊啊啊！

00:28.926 --> 00:31.547
Ugh, you've mingled
Krabby Patty
呃，你们已经混在一起了
蟹肉饼

00:31.547 --> 00:33.754
in my kelp shake.
在我的海带奶昔中。

00:33.754 --> 00:35.650
Sorry, let me refresh that
for you.
抱歉，让我刷新一下
为了你。

00:35.650 --> 00:37.512
Hold your seahorses.
抱紧你的海马。

00:37.512 --> 00:38.823
Hmm.
唔。

00:42.857 --> 00:45.650
It's greasy,
yet cool and refreshing.
很油腻，
却又凉爽又清爽。

00:47.650 --> 00:50.133
Fetch me another posthaste!
赶紧再给我来一次！

00:50.133 --> 00:52.616
- That does look good.
- I want one too.
- 看起来确实不错。
- 我也想要一个。

00:52.616 --> 00:56.271
Ooh, I sense a money-tunity.
哦，我感觉到了金钱的统一。

00:56.271 --> 01:00.237
The brand-new Patty Whip
is now on the menu,
全新帕蒂鞭
现在在菜单上，

01:00.237 --> 01:02.788
available for a moderately
exorbitant upcharge.
可用于适度
过高的加价。

01:04.168 --> 01:06.788
Yep!
是的！

01:06.788 --> 01:08.857
Can I get two to-go?
Two to-go please.
我可以带两个去吗？
请带两份。

01:12.374 --> 01:14.581
Keep those Patty Whips
coming, Mr. Squidward.
保留那些肉饼鞭子
来了，章鱼哥先生。

01:14.581 --> 01:17.271
I'm trying!
Ah, bleh!
我想！
啊，糟糕！

01:22.823 --> 01:24.581
Closing time.
See you tomorrow.
关门时间。
明天见。

01:24.581 --> 01:25.995
Finally.
最后。

01:25.995 --> 01:27.271
Huh?
啊？

01:27.271 --> 01:29.581
You can harden
your arteries tomorrow.
你可以硬化
明天你的动脉。

01:29.581 --> 01:32.685
We're closed!
我们关门了！

01:34.409 --> 01:36.926
The Goobfather
would like to have
傻瓜爸爸
想要拥有

01:36.926 --> 01:39.512
a little talk with your boss.
和你的老板聊聊。

01:39.512 --> 01:41.374
Goobfather?
干爹？

01:41.374 --> 01:44.443
Aren't you the manager
of the Goofy Goober?
你不是经理吗
高飞古伯的？

01:44.443 --> 01:46.478
That's just my day job.
这只是我的日常工作。

01:46.478 --> 01:49.995
The Goobfather
is my true identity.
傻瓜爸爸
是我的真实身份。

01:49.995 --> 01:52.409
I control
all the ice cream trade
我控制
所有的冰淇淋贸易

01:52.409 --> 01:57.409
in this town, and I heard
about your little fatty flips.
在这个小镇上，我听说
关于你的小脂肪翻转。

01:57.409 --> 01:59.823
That's Patty Whips.
那是帕蒂鞭子。

01:59.823 --> 02:01.754
And a little
friendly competition
还有一点
友好竞争

02:01.754 --> 02:03.409
never hurt anyone.
永远不会伤害任何人。

02:03.409 --> 02:05.581
Of course not,
but maybe you should stick
当然不是，
但也许你应该坚持

02:05.581 --> 02:08.581
to flipping patties
and leave the frozen treats
翻转馅饼
并留下冷冻食品

02:08.581 --> 02:10.478
to the experts, hm?
给专家，嗯？

02:10.478 --> 02:14.374
I'm not gonna stop selling
my newest moneymaker.
我不会停止销售
我最新的赚钱工具。

02:14.374 --> 02:17.512
Do your stuff, boys.
做你的事吧，孩子们。

02:21.478 --> 02:25.064
Huh? What?
Mama, I want to sing.
啊？什么？
妈妈，我想唱歌。

02:25.064 --> 02:27.926
Whoa!
Ah!
哇！
啊!

02:30.064 --> 02:32.788
Be thankful I didn't
turn you into gelato.
庆幸我没有
把你变成冰淇淋。

02:32.788 --> 02:35.892
Good one, boss.
好一个，老板。

02:36.719 --> 02:38.064
- Oh!
- Aw.
- 哦！
- 噢。

02:38.064 --> 02:40.409
No more Patty Whips.
不再有帕蒂鞭子了。

02:40.409 --> 02:44.133
Don't worry, boyo.
This is me restaurant.
别担心，小伙子。
这是我的餐厅。

02:44.133 --> 02:48.926
And no one tells me
what's on me menu but me.
并且没有人告诉我
除了我之外，我的菜单上还有什么。

02:54.857 --> 02:56.616
Huh?
啊？

03:00.926 --> 03:03.685
The Patty Whip machine,
it's working again!
帕蒂鞭打机，
它又开始工作了！

03:08.650 --> 03:10.512
I spent all night
rebuilding it.
我花了一整夜
重建它。

03:10.512 --> 03:12.857
Patty Whips are back
on the menu!
帕蒂鞭子回来了
在菜单上！

03:12.857 --> 03:15.237
But, Mr. Krabs,
what if the Goobfather
但是，蟹老板，
如果傻瓜爸爸怎么办

03:15.237 --> 03:18.374
and his goober goons come back?
- Don't worry.
他的傻瓜们又回来了？
- 不用担心。

03:18.374 --> 03:21.478
I brought in
a little protection meself.
我带进来了
一点点保护自己。

03:21.478 --> 03:23.616
Come on out, boys.
出来吧，孩子们。

03:27.409 --> 03:30.892
Uh, aren't they a little,
uh, elderly?
呃，他们是不是有点，
呃，老人？

03:30.892 --> 03:33.306
We may be a little wrinkly...
我们可能有点皱纹...

03:33.306 --> 03:36.340
But we're as tough as jerky!
Ooh!
但我们却像肉干一样坚强！
哦！

03:36.340 --> 03:37.754
Bleh!
哎呀！

03:37.754 --> 03:39.099
We're dead.
我们死了。

03:39.099 --> 03:41.340
Ah, oh!
啊，哦！

03:41.340 --> 03:45.306
The Goobfather would like
to have another little talk.
古布爸爸想要
再聊一聊。

03:45.306 --> 03:48.857
Well, if it isn't
the crab who don't listen.
好吧，如果不是的话
不听话的螃蟹。

03:48.857 --> 03:51.168
Teach him another lesson, boys!
孩子们，再教训他一次！

03:51.168 --> 03:54.340
Not so fast, Goobfather.
没那么快，古爸爸。

03:54.340 --> 03:56.995
Throw these interlopers
out of me restaurant.
扔掉这些闯入者
走出我的餐厅。

03:59.719 --> 04:02.443
Initiate formation 42!
启动42阵型！

04:02.443 --> 04:05.719
Hey, look, is that a sale
on brass knuckles?
嘿，你看，这是在卖吗？
在指节铜套上？

04:05.719 --> 04:09.547
- Brass knuckles?
- Ooh, do they have my size?
- 指节铜套？
- 哦，他们有我的尺码吗？

04:10.961 --> 04:14.168
Ooh, sorry.
哦，抱歉。

04:14.168 --> 04:16.685
Uh-oh, time to skedaddle.
呃哦，是时候溜达了。

04:16.685 --> 04:18.409
Oh!
哦！

04:18.409 --> 04:20.892
Oh, these goons are good.
No!
哦，这些暴徒是好样的。
不！

04:25.581 --> 04:27.754
Well, we're whipped.
好吧，我们被鞭打了。

04:27.754 --> 04:30.650
Next time you hire
some muscle, Krabs,
下次雇用时
一些肌肉，螃蟹，

04:30.650 --> 04:33.374
make sure they have muscles.
确保他们有肌肉。

04:33.374 --> 04:34.478
Huh?
啊？

04:34.478 --> 04:37.616
Eat goobers, you goofballs!
吃点傻瓜吧，你们这些傻瓜！

04:37.616 --> 04:41.719
Ah, oh, ah!
啊啊啊啊！

04:46.030 --> 04:47.995
Enough of this bilge water.
这些舱底水已经够了。

04:47.995 --> 04:52.547
Time to take the fight
to the Goobfather's home turf.
是时候去战斗了
到了Goobfather的主场。

05:08.616 --> 05:10.892
Sorry, sorry.
对不起，对不起。

05:10.892 --> 05:12.961
Sorry.
对不起。

05:14.478 --> 05:17.685
Oy, keep your eye open
for anything worth sabotaging.
哦，睁大你的眼睛
对于任何值得破坏的事情。

05:20.168 --> 05:22.409
- Hey, you!
- Who, me?
- 嘿，你！
- 谁，我？

05:22.409 --> 05:23.340
Um, um...
嗯，嗯...

05:23.340 --> 05:25.064
Give me a double scoop
给我两勺

05:25.064 --> 05:28.581
of kelp swirl
with extra sprinkles.
海带漩涡
加上额外的洒水。

05:28.581 --> 05:29.650
Coming up.
即将到来。

05:29.650 --> 05:32.616
Double K swirl
and make it snow.
双K漩涡
并让它下雪。

05:32.616 --> 05:34.754
Mmm!
嗯！

05:36.616 --> 05:38.237
Hmm.
唔。

05:38.237 --> 05:41.271
That thermostat, that'll do.
那个恒温器就可以了。

05:41.271 --> 05:43.719
Now all we need
is a distraction.
现在我们需要的就是
是一种干扰。

05:43.719 --> 05:47.099
Don't worry, Mr. Krabs.
I've got it handled.
别担心，蟹老板。
我已经处理好了

05:47.099 --> 05:48.547
Ta-da!
哒哒！

05:51.099 --> 05:53.202
Oh, yeah!
Check me out!
哦，是啊！
给我看看！

05:53.202 --> 05:54.685
Uh-huh, uh-huh.
嗯嗯，嗯嗯。

05:54.685 --> 05:58.340
It's so lame, but I can't
take my eyes off the guy.
太蹩脚了，但我做不到
把我的目光从那个家伙身上移开。

05:58.340 --> 06:01.788
I can feel the rhythm
of his scoops in my soul.
我能感觉到节奏
他在我灵魂中的勺子。

06:01.788 --> 06:03.961
Oh, this is the tricky part.
哦，这是棘手的部分。

06:03.961 --> 06:05.995
This'll sizzle their sorbet.
这会让他们的冰糕发出嘶嘶声。

06:05.995 --> 06:10.685
Try and keep up, y'all.
Oh, my scoops are on fire.
努力跟上，你们大家。
哦，我的勺子着火了。

06:10.685 --> 06:13.788
His funky scoops
are so smokin' hot,
他的时髦独家新闻
太热了，

06:13.788 --> 06:16.995
I'm sweating.
- Hm?
我出汗了。
- 嗯？

06:16.995 --> 06:19.823
Oh.
哦。

06:19.823 --> 06:21.547
It's not his spoons.
这不是他的勺子。

06:21.547 --> 06:23.719
Someone's turned up the heat.
有人把暖气调高了。

06:23.719 --> 06:26.616
The ice cream
is going critical!
冰淇淋
即将危急！

06:26.616 --> 06:28.754
- Big finish!
- Come on, kid!
- 大结局！
- 来吧，孩子！

06:28.754 --> 06:30.650
It's time to blow
this ice cream stand
是时候吹了
这个冰淇淋摊

06:30.650 --> 06:32.823
before this
ice cream stand blows!
在此之前
冰淇淋摊炸了！

06:43.581 --> 06:46.581
Time to cheese it, boyo!
是时候干酪了，男孩！

06:46.581 --> 06:48.926
Never mess
with an old Navy man!
永远不要弄乱
和一位老海军一起！

06:48.926 --> 06:51.443
Ooh, I'll get you, Krabs,
哦，我会抓住你的，蟹蟹，

06:51.443 --> 06:54.099
and your little sponge too!
还有你的小海绵！

06:58.995 --> 07:03.099
Prepare to be annihilated!
做好被歼灭的准备吧！

07:06.409 --> 07:09.064
Mr. Krabs, it's the Goobfather!
蟹老板，这是Goobfather！

07:09.064 --> 07:11.478
We're about to be hit
by a competing restaurant.
我们即将被击中
由一家竞争餐厅提供。

07:11.478 --> 07:14.788
Don't worry, SpongeBob.
we're ready for 'em.
别担心，海绵宝宝。
我们已经准备好迎接他们了。

07:22.788 --> 07:27.443
Hm? Hm.
Deploy soft serve cannons!
嗯？嗯。
部署软发球大炮！

07:27.443 --> 07:29.823
Activate toffee treads!
激活太妃糖踏板！

07:29.823 --> 07:32.788
Hot fudge howitzer!
热软糖榴弹炮！

07:34.892 --> 07:36.478
Try the engines, boyo!
试试引擎，男孩！

07:36.478 --> 07:38.340
Aye, aye, Mr. Krabs!
是啊，是啊，蟹老板！

07:41.340 --> 07:43.685
Oh!
Mmm.
哦！
嗯。

07:47.271 --> 07:49.512
Fire ice cream cannons!
发射冰淇淋大炮！

07:49.512 --> 07:52.857
Firing ice cream cannons!
发射冰淇淋大炮！

07:54.099 --> 07:56.271
Evasive maneuvers!
回避动作！

07:57.857 --> 07:59.409
Return fire!
还击！

07:59.409 --> 08:02.306
Oh, er, return ice cream!
噢，呃，还冰淇淋！

08:02.306 --> 08:03.961
Have a double scoop!
来一勺双勺吧！

08:03.961 --> 08:05.857
Whoa!
Ah!
哇！
啊!

08:05.857 --> 08:07.443
Brain freeze!
大脑冻结！

08:07.443 --> 08:10.202
Eat hot fudge, villain!
吃热软糖吧，恶棍！

08:11.650 --> 08:15.995
Ugh, such sticky
yet delicious pain!
呃，这么粘
但又美味的痛苦！

08:15.995 --> 08:17.271
Ugh.
啊。

08:17.271 --> 08:20.202
Don't forget the sprinkles!
别忘了洒水！

08:20.202 --> 08:23.754
- Whoa!
- Launch sugar cone drones!
- 哇！
- 发射甜筒无人机！

08:29.719 --> 08:30.754
Hm?
嗯？

08:31.823 --> 08:32.754
- Huh?
- Huh?
- 啊？
- 啊？

08:34.650 --> 08:38.616
I'm sending you
to the deep freeze, Krabs!
我给你发
到了极寒之地，蟹蟹们！

08:38.616 --> 08:41.857
In your ice dreams,
Goobfather!
在你的冰梦里，
干爹！

08:44.719 --> 08:46.616
Oh, fudge.
胡说八道。

08:49.306 --> 08:53.133
Ugh, not giving up.
呃，不放弃。

08:53.133 --> 08:56.064
Ugh, me neither.
呃，我也一样。

09:04.685 --> 09:07.064
Ha! Ah!
哈!啊!

09:08.961 --> 09:10.443
Wow!
哇！

09:12.064 --> 09:14.409
Ah!
- Ow!
啊!
- 噢！

09:14.409 --> 09:16.340
What's that sound?
那是什么声音？

09:16.340 --> 09:17.892
It couldn't be.
不可能。

09:23.133 --> 09:25.443
The Ice Cream King!
冰淇淋大王！

09:25.443 --> 09:30.133
Cease your hostil-lily--
hostile--
停止你的敌意——
充满敌意——

09:30.133 --> 09:31.719
quit fightin'!
别再打了！

09:31.719 --> 09:34.306
Ice cream isn't meant
for brawling!
冰淇淋的意思不是
为了打架！

09:34.306 --> 09:36.995
It's supposed to bring
sugar fueled fun,
应该会带来
糖带来乐趣，

09:36.995 --> 09:41.409
belly aches, and brain freezes
to the world.
肚子疼，大脑冻结
到世界。

09:41.409 --> 09:43.306
He's right.
他是对的。

09:43.306 --> 09:45.685
We shouldn't be fighting.
我们不应该打架。

09:45.685 --> 09:49.099
There's plenty of saps--
or, customers in town
有很多汁液——
或者，城里的顾客

09:49.099 --> 09:50.512
for both of us.
对于我们俩来说。

09:53.892 --> 09:55.581
Mmm.
嗯。

09:55.581 --> 09:57.064
And if you
don't quit fighting,
如果你
不要放弃战斗，

09:57.064 --> 10:00.340
I'll use my ultimate weapon,
the ice cream bomb!
我会使用我的终极武器
冰淇淋炸弹！

10:00.340 --> 10:02.099
Ice cream bomb?
冰淇淋炸弹？

10:02.099 --> 10:03.202
Wait!
等待！

10:03.202 --> 10:05.133
We've already
stopped fighting!
我们已经
停止战斗！

10:05.133 --> 10:07.719
What?
I can't hear you!
什么？
我听不到你说话！

10:07.719 --> 10:09.857
Uh, hold on,
I'll be right down.
呃，坚持住，
我马上下来。

10:09.857 --> 10:11.788
Bombs away!
炸弹走开！

10:11.788 --> 10:14.099
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

10:14.099 --> 10:18.237
Yee-haw!
Yee-ha-haw!
呀呀！
呀哈哈！

10:29.650 --> 10:32.616
Hey, everyone,
free ice cream!
嘿，大家，
免费冰淇淋！

10:32.616 --> 10:35.788
- Whoo-hoo!
- Oh, ooh.
- 呼呼！
- 哦，哦。

10:39.030 --> 10:40.512
Is this a dream?
这是梦吗？

10:40.512 --> 10:44.237
Free ice cream forever!
永久免费冰淇淋！

10:44.237 --> 10:46.892
You're welcome!
不客气！

10:46.892 --> 10:51.719
Oh, it looks like
we're all out of business.
哦，看起来像
我们都失业了。

10:51.719 --> 10:55.650
Will someone
please get me down?
有人会吗
请让我下来好吗？

10:55.650 --> 10:57.099
Ow!
噢！

10:57.099 --> 10:58.719
Typical.
典型的。

典型的。